ot -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"posts-foot\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"posts-tag\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">사업기획<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">상품기획<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">영어<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">건강식품교육<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">건기식<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">비임상실험설계<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">제품연구개발<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">개별인정원료<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">영문서류번역요약<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"posts-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"text\">1. 건기식 원료 개발 및 전임상 임상 디자인\r<br/>    개별인정형 원료 개발을 위한 디자인\r<br/>    전임상, 임상 디자인\r<br/>2. 건강기능식품 제품군 개발 \r<br/>   과학적 근거에 의한 제품 포뮬라 완성\r<br/>   타겟층별 제품군 개발\r<br/>   라이프스타일 별 제품군 개발\r<br/>3. 건기식 원료 및 제품 교육\r<br/>    과학적원리 교육\r<br/>    작용기전 설명\r<br/>    인체 내에서의 작용 설명\r<br/>4. 의약품, 건기식 관련 영문 문서 번역 및 비즈니스 서신 작성\r<br/>   해외 임상서류, CDMO 서류, 강연 동영상, 회의록 등\r<br/>   \r<br/><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- //posts-foot -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"posts-expert-wrap\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- posts-expert -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"posts-expert\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"expert-profile recommend-badge\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"expert-face expert-not-face\" id=\"m_imageTxt24388\">><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<script type=\"text/javascript\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t$(\"#m_imageTxt24388\").addClass(\"bg\" + (Math.floor(Math.random() * 4) + 1));\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t$(\"#m_imageTxt24388\").html(gf_setFieldImg(\"M\"));\n\t\t\t\t