t<!-- //posts-rows -->\n\t<\/li>\n\n\t<li class=\"posts-item\">\n\t\t<!-- posts-rows -->\n\t\t<div class=\"posts-rows\">\n\t\t\t<!-- posts-cols -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"posts-cols posts-data\">\n\t\t\t\t<!-- posts-main -->\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"posts-main\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"posts-content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"expert.html?userSeq=371\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- posts-head -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"posts-head\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"posts-name\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"text\">스타트업과 중소기업의 성장단계에 적합한 HR솔루션을 개발합니다<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"posts-info\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"info-area\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"info-item expert-field\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t인사/총무\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"info-item expert-field\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPM\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- //posts-head -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- posts-foot -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"posts-foot\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"posts-tag\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">인사기획<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">조직문화<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">신인사제도<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">보상기획<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">hr전략<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">채용제도<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">인사컨설팅<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">전문직제<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">직군별보상차별화<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">합리적인임금체계<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">직급체계개선<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">쿠팡<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">배달의민족<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">넷마블게임즈<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"posts-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"text\">대기업 & 스타트업 대상, 인사제도(직급, 평가, 채용, 보상제도) 개선 프로젝트가 저의 전문분야입니다. \r<br/>\r<br/>삼성화재(9년)에서는 신입/경력채용, 평가보상, 인사발령, 노사관리 등 회사 전반에 걸친 HR실무를 폭넓게 경험할 수 있었으며, 삼성경제연구소(3년)에서는 미국/일본 선진기업 HR 벤치마킹을 통해 삼성전자 등 그룹 계열사의 인사제도 기획 및 개선 프로젝트를 1년 이상 리딩한 경험이 있습니다. \r<br/>\r<br/>이처럼 경험과 전문지식을 바탕으로 회사 경영상황에 적합한 인사제도 기획 및 개선 프로젝트에 참여하고 싶습니다.<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- //posts-foot -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"posts-expert-wrap\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- posts-expert -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"posts-expert\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"expert-profile recommend-badge\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"expert-face\" style=\"background-image:url(assets/mirror/449c421bfe152515c97a.bin);\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg width=\"24\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 32\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <g id=\"&#236;&#182;&#148;&#236;&#178;&#156;\"> <g id=\"_1\"> <path id=\"Vector\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M6.07289 17.395L1.82764 29.1665L6.2523 27.9533L8.87984 31.7143L12.9714 20.368C12.5157 20.2419 6.63567 18.8167 6.07264 17.395H6.07289Z\" fill=\"#0064B2\"/> <path id=\"Vector_2\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M17.7545 17.395L21.9998 29.1665L17.5751 27.9533L14.9476 31.7143L10.856 20.368C11.3117 20.2419 17.1917 18.8167 17.7548 17.395H17.7545Z\" fill=\"#0064B2\"/> <g id=\"Vector_3\" style=\"mix-blend-mode:overlay\" opacity=\"0.7\"> <pa