d -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"posts-head\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"posts-name\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"text\">패션 상품 및 브랜드 기획자(MD), 액셀러레이터<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"posts-info\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"info-area\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"info-item expert-field\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t마케팅\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"info-item expert-field\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t경영전략/신사업\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"info-item expert-field\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t영업/구매/유통\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"info-item expert-field\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t제품/공간디자인\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"info-item expert-field\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t투자/IPO\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- //posts-head -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- posts-foot -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"posts-foot\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"posts-tag\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">마케팅<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">비즈니스모델<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">사업계획서<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">사업기획<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">스타트업<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">창업<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">패션<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">상품기획<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">디자인<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">브랜드<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">섬유<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">투자유치<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">md<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">의류<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">머천다이저<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"posts-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"text\">패션 대기업 20년 경력의 상품기획자로 국내외 신규 브랜드 런칭(국내 2개, 중국 2개) 및 브랜드 총괄 사업부장으로 근무했습니다.<br/>20년간 다수의 사내 프로젝트(전사 ERP구축 프로젝트 外)에 참여함으로써 프로젝트 기반 업무수행 경험을 가지고 있습니다.<br/>지금은 경영지도사 및 액셀러레이터의 파트너로써 초기 스타트업의 성장을 위해 비즈니스 모델, 사업계획서 및 마케팅 실무에 대한 교육, 멘토링 등을 지원하고 있습니다.<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- //posts-foot -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"posts-expert-wrap\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- posts-expert -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"posts-expert\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"expert-profile recommend-badge\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"expert-face\" style=\"background-image:url(assets/mirror/be0b44bbb748ab88d0bf);\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"expert-menu\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"expert-name\">cover**<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"expert-consultation\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- disabled class 추가로 비활성화 처리-->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- <button class=\"disabled\"><\/button> -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<button class=\"\" onclick=\"lf_requiredCounsel('1690', 'COU_TP001')\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t전화자문\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 6 10\" fill=\"none\"> <path d=\"M1 9L5 5.0182L1 1\" stroke=\"#0064B2\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin