 -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"posts-head\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"posts-name\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"text\">맞춤형 CS전략 수립, 해외 법인 운영, 고객관리 전문가<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"posts-info\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"info-area\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"info-item expert-field\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCS\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"info-item expert-field\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t물류/유통\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"info-item expert-field\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t온라인마케팅\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"info-item expert-field\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t서비스기획\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- //posts-head -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- posts-foot -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"posts-foot\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"posts-tag\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">cs역량향상<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">콜센터구축<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">cs센터구축<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">해외cs조직구축<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">cs프로세스설계<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">cs시스템구축<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">cs품질향상<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"tag\">cs개선방안<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"posts-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"text\">1. 해외 CS 및 사업 컨설팅\r<br/> - 인도네시아(5년), 유럽(4년), 미국(4년) CS운영 전략 수립 가능\r<br/> - 해외 법인 운영, 성과 관리, 서비스 기획\r<br/> - 소모품, 연장보증, 구독서비스 , 이커머스 사업 \r<br/>\r<br/>2. 국내 CS 컨설팅\r<br/> - 고객 VOC / Pain Point 분석 및 개선 방안 수립 \r<br/> - 콜센터/네트워크/기술지원/부품관리/교육 운영 전략 수립<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- //posts-foot -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"posts-expert-wrap\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- posts-expert -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"posts-expert\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"expert-profile recommend-badge\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"expert-face\" style=\"background-image:url(assets/mirror/991cb47ad4a1c1a58205.bin);\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg width=\"24\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 32\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <g id=\"&#236;&#182;&#148;&#236;&#178;&#156;\"> <g id=\"_1\"> <path id=\"Vector\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M6.07289 17.395L1.82764 29.1665L6.2523 27.9533L8.87984 31.7143L12.9714 20.368C12.5157 20.2419 6.63567 18.8167 6.07264 17.395H6.07289Z\" fill=\"#0064B2\"/> <path id=\"Vector_2\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M17.7545 17.395L21.9998 29.1665L17.5751 27.9533L14.9476 31.7143L10.856 20.368C11.3117 20.2419 17.1917 18.8167 17.7548 17.395H17.7545Z\" fill=\"#0064B2\"/> <g id=\"Vector_3\" style=\"mix-blend-mode:overlay\" opacity=\"0.7\"> <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M19.4465 22.086L18.9697 20.7637C18.9204 20.8883 18.876 21.0177 18.8376 21.1532C18.567 22.1123 18.0194 22.5918 17.1951 22.5918C16.9845 22.5918 16.7558 22.5605 16.5087 22.4979C16.1927 22.4176 15.8872 22.3774 15.5925 22.3774C14.7569 22.3774 14.0078 22.7001 13.3452 23.3454C12.9509 23.7292 12.5566 23.9441 12.1626 23.9904L12.4748 24.856C12.996 24.7475 13.4995 24.4593 13.9773 23.9944C14.4687 23.5159 14.9973 23.2832 15.593 23.2832C15.8111 23.2832 16.0446 23.3144 16.2864 23.3756C16.6049 23.4564 16.9107 23.4975 17.1956 23.4975C17.8114 23